Resource optimization should be performed regularly to ensure Azure resources continue meeting workload requirements efficiently.

Optimization reviews focus on:

* Compute utilization
* Storage consumption
* Network performance
* Cost efficiency
* Resource availability
* Security recommendations
* Resource lifecycle

For example, administrators may identify underutilized virtual machines and replace them with smaller instances to reduce monthly cloud expenditure.

A real-life use case is enterprises conducting quarterly optimization exercises to improve both performance and financial efficiency.

Regular optimization reviews maximize the return on Azure investments.
